  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nauru-Australia Partnership on Economic Governance (NAPEG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is assisting the Government of Nauru to strengthen and implement a robust public financial management system that supports the allocation of Nauru&apos;s resources to benefit all Nauruans and to strengthen the enabling environment for economic diversification. The program supports the Government of Nauru to provide fiscally inclusive service delivery and maintain balanced budgets, public savings targets and responsible debt management (macroeconomic stability). The program supports improved, gender responsive and socially inclusive budget and budget cycle/processes that align with inclusive service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
